OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran, 102, recalls German
OL,4,Atorpedo attack horror
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We got thrown to the deck and the chap
OL,7,Fbehind me had a large shell in his
OL,8,Farms, and he came down on top of me
OL,9,Fwith the shell on my leg. He was washed
OL,10,Foverboard."
OL,12,FAs HMS Charybdis went down, John and
OL,13,Fother survivors swam off the deck into
OL,14,Fthe freezing waters, desperately
OL,15,Fholding on to debris and a lifeboat to
OL,16,Fstay afloat.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
